meta {
  name: 4 Mark all read
  type: http
  seq: 4
}
post {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
  body: none
}
docs {
  `{ "markedRead": <n> }`. One multi-document `$set` scoped by the caller's own claim — there is no
  address in the request to substitute, so it cannot clear anyone else's inbox.

  `read-all`, not `read`, so it can never collide with `{id}/read`. Zero changed is a **success**, not
  a `404`: tapping it twice must not surface an error the second time.
}
